{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51964","headline":"梅溪烟雨 · 吕岩","name":"梅溪烟雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摩挲睡眼望山凹，非雾非烟景四郊。\n一幅生绡不收拾，被风展却挂林梢。\n（以上《嘉靖常德府志》十九。\n又《古今图书集成·职方典》一二六二《常德府志》及《山川典》一六二《桃源山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}